sequenceDiagram
    actor O as Operator
    actor P as Planner
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as MySQL
    O->>FE: today's activities
    FE->>BE: GET /operator/today
    BE->>DB: assignments of approved plans, execution events
    BE-->>FE: activities with state (TODO, IN_PROGRESS, PAUSED, DONE)
    O->>FE: Start
    FE->>BE: POST /executions {START}
    alt predecessor not done, or another activity in progress
        BE-->>FE: 409
    else allowed
        BE->>DB: append execution event
        BE-->>FE: 201 activity IN_PROGRESS
    end
    O->>FE: report a breakdown
    FE->>BE: POST /incidents {BREAKDOWN, resource}
    BE->>DB: save report
    BE-->>FE: 201 {id: AL-31}
    P->>FE: alerts
    FE->>BE: GET /alerts
    BE-->>FE: AL-31 with event RESOURCE_DOWN and link to the plan
    P->>FE: Reschedule
    FE->>BE: POST /plans/PLAN-0042/reschedule {event, freezeBefore, alertId}
    BE->>DB: unavailability of the resource, close AL-31, new request (rescheduleOf)
    BE-->>FE: 202 {id: REQ-0015}
    Note over BE,DB: started activities stay frozen, the rest is planned again (3 plans + baselines)
    P->>FE: approve a new plan
    FE->>BE: POST /plans/PLAN-0051/decisions {APPROVE}
    BE->>DB: PLAN-0051 APPROVED, PLAN-0042 SUPERSEDED, audit DECISION
    BE-->>FE: 201
